# BuildKit prefers <dockerfile>.dockerignore over the context-root .dockerignore.
# argo's root .dockerignore EXCLUDES .git (plus *.md / *.yaml / .github / docs /
# sdks / test/e2e / vendor). But the commit-image grader AND the air-gapped PATCH
# re-run need the FULL .git history COPYed into /mayhem (mayhem.yml checks out with
# fetch-depth 0 for exactly this). So we override here: KEEP .git and the harnessed
# source (pkg/apis/workflow/v1alpha1/progress.go + mayhem/), and only drop the
# genuinely-heavy trees the mini-module build never reads.
ui/node_modules
ui/dist
dist
vendor
site
docs
sdks
test/e2e
